==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Loris]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Othom]] spawns as the boss after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
**3 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**2 [[Loris|Lorises]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
**2 [[Mr. Puffington]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This entire stage dies to you spamming [[Slapstick Cats]]. Add a few meatshields like [[Modern Cat]] and maybe Strong Up combos if your Slapsticks aren't boosted enough and that should be enough for a free win.

